using the record identity present in the supplied observations. State the
condition that distinguishes unsafe from safe behavior in terms of operation
arguments, session facts, observed record facts, or call ordering. An observed
value is evidence for that condition; an observed value alone is not the
semantic failure criterion. A sentence that only restates the governing
