Authorized behavior is not a loss merely because it uses sensitive data.
Preserve the supplied permission boundary, intended recipient and legitimate
function. For example, showing an authenticated library member their own loan
record is different from showing it to an unauthorized person. Do not invent
the recipient, access restriction or disclosure to make a loss claim work.

Temporal conditions use the explained local handles in the user prompt. Use
